        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Left shoulder examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "No deformity or swelling. Tender over greater tuberosity/subacromial area. Active abduction limited to approximately 90–100 degrees with pain; flexion limited above shoulder height; reduced internal rotation and difficulty reaching behind back. Passive movement slightly greater but painful in the mid-arc. Positive painful arc at 70–120 degrees, positive Hawkins and Neer. Jobe mildly painful, power approximately normal; external rotation power preserved. Distal neurovascular status intact. Neck full range of motion and non-tender."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-17",
